  "kind": "regulation",
  "number": "22.5",
  "ref": "TMR1995/r22.5",
  "text": "If: (a) the Registrar has extended a period of time under section 130 or 131 of the Trade Marks Act 1955; and (b) the extended period of time had not ended before the commencement of these regulations; the period ends when it would have ended if that section had continued to be in force.",
